{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>And the land shall not vomit you out.</b> It is joined with the verse after it, ״כי כל אשר יעשה״, as if it said: the land shall not vomit you out alone, as it vomited — that is, do not think you will be absolved by this, but you will be punished with the punishment of karet."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:26:33.162835146Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}